---
---

<section id="about" class="content-section">
  <!-- Stat counters row -->
  <div class="stats-grid reveal-group">
    <div class="stat-card reveal">
      <span class="stat-value" style="color: var(--color-primary)">1500+</span>
      <span class="stat-label">Problems Solved</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card reveal">
      <span class="stat-value" style="color: var(--color-secondary)">3×</span>
      <span class="stat-label">ICPC Regional</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card reveal">
      <span class="stat-value" style="color: var(--color-accent)">3.52</span>
      <span class="stat-label">CGPA at BUBT</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card reveal">
      <span class="stat-value" style="color: var(--color-green)">5+</span>
      <span class="stat-label">Years in CP</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- About text -->
  <div class="section-heading reveal">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <div class="heading-bar"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-body">
    <p class="body-md reveal">
      I'm a <span class="hl">final-year CSE student</span> at
      <span class="hl">Bangladesh University of Business and Technology (BUBT)</span>,
      passionate about building robust backend systems and solving hard algorithmic problems.
    </p>
    <p class="body-md reveal">
      On the engineering side, I work primarily with <span class="hl">C# / .NET</span>,
      <span class="hl">Python</span>, and <span class="hl">Docker</span> — building systems like
      a full-featured <span class="hl">Online Judge</span> with real-time code execution,
      and ML pipelines for <span class="hl">Fruit Quality Detection</span> (98.97% mAP)
      and <span class="hl">Facial Emotion Recognition for Autism</span> (89% accuracy).
    </p>
    <p class="body-md reveal">
      On the competitive side, I'm a <span class="hl">3× ICPC Asia Dhaka Regionalist</span>,
      <span class="hl">Specialist on Codeforces</span> (peak 1619),
      <span class="hl">Knight on LeetCode</span>, and <span class="hl">3-Star on CodeChef</span>.
      I've solved 1500+ problems across platforms and taught CP as an instructor.
    </p>

    <!-- Availability banner -->
    <div class="availability-banner reveal">
      <span class="pulse-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p>Open to full-time Software Engineering roles</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .content-section {
    padding: var(--spacing-xxl) var(--spacing-xxl);

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);
    }
  }

  /* Stats */
  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xxl);

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .stat-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-md);
    background: var(--color-glass);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-glass-border);
    border-radius: var(--rounded-xl);
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;

    &:hover {
      border-color: rgba(83, 58, 253, 0.3);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
  }

  .stat-value {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    font-feature-settings: "tnum" on;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* About text */
  .about-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);

    .body-md {
      color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
      margin: 0;
    }
  }

  /* Keyword highlight */
  .hl {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Availability */
  .availability-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);
    background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--rounded-lg);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-md);

    p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: var(--color-green);
    }
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-green);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    animation: pulse-green 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse-green {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.6); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0); }
  }
</style>
